  "notes": [
    "Factory settings: 9600 bit/s, 8 data bits, no parity, 1 stop bit.",
    "Multi-register values have the high word first.",
    "Phase-neutral values, phase powers and phase power factors are valid only in the 4-wire setting.",
    "The settings at 0x28 to 0x2A hold one value in each byte; this map takes the first value of the manual's row as the high byte.",
    "The manual gives no factory address; 1 is assumed.",
    "Energies at 0x82 to 0x89 are on the secondary side (multiply by the transformer ratios); the floats at 0x8A to 0x91 are on the primary side, with the unit assumed to be kWh or kvarh.",
    "The demand, tariff, harmonic and maximum value registers of the KWDT-M (from 0x00C0) are not listed.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
